B-52 Stratofortress - Heavy Bomber  Armament: 4 12,7 mm guns in tail turret or 1 20 mm cannon, carries up to 60,000 lb of bombs including up to 84 500 lb bombs in bomb bay, and 24 750 lb bombs on wing pylons. Any combination of iron bombs to equal 60,000 lb will do. Can carry 8 Harpoon air-sea missiles in anti-shipping role.